From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Lopez <norelec@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:02:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Top bar: Map cycles through small radar, large radar and
 world map

Each press moves on: nothing open -> the small radar, small -> large, large ->
the world map in the radar's place, world map -> the small radar again. The
cycle lives in TopBarGump.MapCycle.cs; TopBarGump.cs only calls it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFcBNQtF3Z7vfzi99BXwUe
---
 src/ClassicUO.Client/Game/UI/Gumps/TopBarGump.cs | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ClassicUO.Client/Game/UI/Gumps/TopBarGump.cs b/src/ClassicUO.Client/Game/UI/Gumps/TopBarGump.cs
index 68bafdbb2..f3e2de92d 100644
--- a/src/ClassicUO.Client/Game/UI/Gumps/TopBarGump.cs
+++ b/src/ClassicUO.Client/Game/UI/Gumps/TopBarGump.cs
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ using Microsoft.Xna.Framework;
 
 namespace ClassicUO.Game.UI.Gumps
 {
-    internal class TopBarGump : Gump
+    internal partial class TopBarGump : Gump
     {
         private TopBarGump(World world) : base(world, 0, 0)
         {
@@ -203,7 +203,7 @@ namespace ClassicUO.Game.UI.Gumps
             switch ((Buttons)buttonID)
             {
                 case Buttons.Map:
-                    GameActions.OpenWorldMap(World);
+                    CycleMap();
 
                     break;
 
